            <ArticleTitle>A clarification on endodontic flare-ups.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>345-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In an article on endodontic flare-ups by Robert J. Matusow, our research and publications are discussed. Since we found what we consider to be distortions and misinterpretations of our work, it was decided to clarify the apparent discrepancies found in Matusow's article.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
